# Descriptor: [anti-B0 -> D_2*+ l- nu, D_2*+ -> D*+ pi+ pi- pi0] gap mode
# NickName: B0_D2stlnu_Dstpipipi_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode; three-pion contribution to semileptonic gap via D_2*(2460)+,
#   isospin partner of decfiles/gap_modes/Bplus/Dst0pipipipenu (anti-D_2*0 -> anti-D*0 pi+ pi- pi0).
#   Generated by the full-isospin generalization of the SEM/Hausdorff pipeline: same rough
#   3-body PHSP placeholder as the Bplus file, just D*0 -> D*+ (pion charges unchanged).
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260831

Alias D2stpipipisig D_2*+
Alias anti-D2stpipipisig D_2*-
ChargeConj D2stpipipisig anti-D2stpipipisig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B0sig anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.500 D2stpipipisig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
0.500 D2stpipipisig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay D2stpipipisig
1.0   D*+  pi+  pi-  pi0   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-D2stpipipisig

End
